---
/**
 * Visually hidden until focused. The first focusable thing on every route,
 * so a keyboard user does not have to tab through the nav to reach content.
 * Targets #main-content, which BaseLayout puts on <main>.
 *
 * -translate-y-20 is Tailwind's default transform scale, not the project's
 * spacing tokens — it is exempt from the "no arbitrary values" rule because
 * it isn't a spacing/rhythm decision, just "far enough off-screen to hide."
 * (Was -translate-y-16; that left a ~3px sliver of the ink fill peeking
 * below the top edge — 4rem does not clear the 1rem top offset plus the
 * link's own height. 5rem does.) Every value that IS spacing or type reads
 * a token instead.
 *
 * 2026-09-10, plain-text reset: ink fill kept (highest contrast, no accent
 * to use); stencil/uppercase treatment dropped.
 */
---

<a
  href="#main-content"
  class="bg-ink text-page duration-quick top-gutter left-gutter p-gutter text-meta fixed z-50 -translate-y-20 font-semibold transition-transform focus:translate-y-0"
>
  Skip to content
</a>
